.TH SDL_CalculateGPUTextureFormatSize 3 "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 FUNCTIONS"
.SH NAME
SDL_CalculateGPUTextureFormatSize \- Calculate the size in bytes of a texture format with dimensions.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_gpu.h>
.PP
.BI "Uint32 SDL_CalculateGPUTextureFormatSize(
.BI "    SDL_GPUTextureFormat format,
.BI "    Uint32 width,
.BI "    Uint32 height,
.BI "    Uint32 depth_or_layer_count);
.fi
.SH FUNCTION PARAMETERS
.TP
.I format
a texture format\[char46]
.TP
.I width
width in pixels\[char46]
.TP
.I height
height in pixels\[char46]
.TP
.I depth_or_layer_count
depth for 3D textures or layer count otherwise\[char46]
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the size of a texture with this format and dimensions\[char46]

.SH AVAILABILITY
This function is available since SDL 3\[char46]2\[char46]0\[char46]

